      "title": "Celebrating the End of Enlightenment: Organization Theory in the Age of the Anthropocene and Gaia (and why neither is the solution to our ecological crisis)",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "Subhabrata Bobby Banerjee",
          "openalex_id": "A5052007670",
